        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ But, it will be asked, is tact not an individual gift, therefore highly variable in its choices? And if that is so, what guidance can a manual offer, other than that of its author's prejudices—mere impressionism?",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
